ice data. Files: `src/lib/assistantStatus.ts`, `src/lib/assistantStatusIO.ts`; `assistantTools.ts` (`roles`, `toolsFor`, `till` in the context), `assistantChat.ts` (prompt by tool names), `Assistant.tsx`. Help pages `settings/ask-assistant` (all roles) and `settings/assistant` (manager and owner only) updated, `help.json` rebuilt, spec note in `dev_docs/WRITING_ASSISTANT.md`, plan revision 24. Tests: `tests/assistantstatus.test.ts` (22), and the pinned tool lists, counts and prompt tests were updated. Device test T67. **Decided without you, change any you disagree with:** settings reader for manager and owner only and left out of a cashier's request; the AI assistant group follows the Settings row; the card reader's ready state is reported as the app's own state, not as a terminal detail; no printer is reported because the app has none; refund and pass notices are left out of the status; the Shopify store's own domain is included. Not tried on a real iPad. Not in this patch: cash drawer, calculators and current cart (patch 8), the practice mode coach (patch 9) | your request |
